  "scope": "Project B hosted in a genuine independent nonmodal OS window; Explorer A remains an outstanding main-window overlay.",
  "implementation": [
    "Separate SDL/Nuklear/accessibility/GL owners, immutable shared fonts, explicit manager UI context in every form helper.",
    "Main/detached workspace layouts and input no longer depend on project-manager visibility; background project/workspace changes preserve its private name, parent, template, languages and current step.",
    "Repeated invocation raises the existing form; own Escape/close retires child requests and defers native destruction until outside draw. Focus restoration checks a live source SDL window ID and never overrides another actual focused window.",
    "Only successful submission from this form closes it. Failed creation restores the previous main project-input/example selection. Successful project/workspace changes retire six main-context request routes; parent route4 survives.",
    "Approved CSS compact breakpoint560, compact header/body/steps, wrapping footer and location field, muted subtitle; measured text heights feed card rows, checkbox, hints, review heading and error panel.",
